  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=9033af&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"我的项目\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"我的项目\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"概述\"></p>\n<h3><strong>Biomes O Plenty 兼容数据包</strong></h3>\n<p>此数据包旨在增强 Moog's End Structures 与 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 的集成效果。安装本数据包后，我们现有部分结构的外观将自动替换为使用 Biomes O Plenty 中的方块等内容，在同时安装这两个模组时，带来更加统一且沉浸的体验。</p>\n<h3><strong>使用方法</strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>下载：</strong>下载兼容数据包</li>\n<li><strong>安装：</strong>将整个文件夹放入你世界的 <code>datapacks</code> 文件夹中。</li>\n<li><strong>重载：</strong>运行命令 <code>/datapack enable \"file/moogs_end_structures_bop_compat\"</code> 或 <code>/reload</code> 以应用更改。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3><strong>重要提示</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>此数据包需要同时安装 <strong>Moog's End Structures</strong> 和 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 才能正常运行。</li>\n<li>本数据包所做的具体结构更改仅在安装后生成的新区块中可见。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"Discord\"></p>\n<p>获得回复最快、最好的方式是加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmesbop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"赞助\"></a></p>",
